  \left(2.998 \times 10^8\,\mathrm{m\,s}^{-1}\right)
  }{\lambda}
  =
  \frac{1.196 \times 10^5}{\lambda\,(\mathrm{nm})}
  \,\mathrm{kJ\,mol}^{-1}

